Z||000003||Linx||07-18-2000||11:13 PM||||Yeah- the radiator.  If youve got A.C., you're radiator is behind the condenser, and its waaaay easy to overlook crap stuffed into the fins of your radiator.<P>Mine, 13 years old, was so clogged that y'couldnt see light thru it.  On the other hand, it was so clogged that coolant wouldnt flow, either.  $130 at autozone.||||reg||1
